# The regional sts and sts − rtr maps with regional r₁ partialled out (partB20_regional_partial.py)
git=f1f5fcc

Group maps from regional_sts_r1.csv (partB11: placebo run, pre-injection; ts_gsr; 115 regions); OLS with intercept on regional r₁ (windowed W = 60 windows 1–4; whole-span TRs 0–239 as a sensitivity); Yeo-7 networks from the parcel names, the 16 subcortical parcels as one class; sensory = Vis + SomMot (31 parcels), association = Default + Cont (37 parcels). No spin test (the maps are algebraically linked). Seed 20261120.

## sts map on regional r₁ (windowed)

Slope +3.0887 nats per unit r₁ (r² = 0.745); SD across regions of the map 0.0447, of the residual map 0.0226.
Sensory − association contrast: before partialling -0.0202 nats (-0.45 map SD); after partialling +0.0037 nats (+0.16 residual-map SD); the same contrast of r₁ itself -0.0078.

| network | n | map mean | residual mean | r₁ mean |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Vis | 17 | +1.2837 | +0.0102 | 0.8403 |
| SomMot | 14 | +1.2931 | -0.0082 | 0.8493 |
| DorsAttn | 14 | +1.3082 | +0.0207 | 0.8449 |
| SalVentAttn | 12 | +1.3003 | -0.0000 | 0.8490 |
